    "editorial": {
      "mode": "match_review",
      "question": "网球为什么按15、30、40计分？0分为什么叫love？",
      "thesis": "15、30、45的计分最早见于奥尔良公爵查理被囚英国时写的诗（“我已打到四十五；我们押了注，不是白打”），1555年斯卡伊诺写明每分记15、第三分45；钟面说、皇家网球15尺说都有硬伤，起源至今无定论；45何时变40也无原始记载，1877年温网规则已是15、30、40。love 多数词源学者认为来自“为爱而玩”（不下注、白打，1670年代），1742年已指零分；l'oeuf 说找不到证据。USTA 允许用零一二三代替，ITF 规则没有。",
      "beats": [
        "冷开场：主裁报分 30-15、15-love",
        "最早记载：公爵的诗与皇家网球",
        "1555 斯卡伊诺",
        "两种起源说及其漏洞",
        "45 变 40",
        "love 的三种词源与学界倾向",
        "USTA 零一二三",
        "评论区问题"
      ],
      "human_context": {
        "angle": "计分的来历说不清，最早的记载和 love 的词源却都指向“押注还是白打”。",
        "facts": [
          "Charles d'Orléans Ballade 113：J'ay quarante cinq; sur bon gage nous jouons, non pas por neant（British Academy Review 17, Putter 2011）",
          "Scaino 1555：each stroke won is scored 15 … for the third, 45（Marshall, Annals of Tennis 1878）",
          "钟面说反方：分针普及在约1690年摆钟之后（Milham）；15尺说反方：皇家网球场无统一长度（Shneerson 2015）",
          "1877 温网规则：The real tennis method of scoring by fifteens (15, 30, 40) will be adopted",
          "love 零分义 by 1742，源自 playing for love (1670s)（etymonline / OED）；韦氏编辑部：l'oeuf 说无证据",
          "USTA Friend at Court：Zero, one, two, three may be substituted for Love, 15, 30, 40（ITF 规则无此条）"
        ],
        "sources": [
          "https://www.thebritishacademy.ac.uk/documents/599/BAR17-07-Putter.pdf",
          "https://archive.org/details/annalstennis00marsgoog",
          "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennis_scoring_system",
          "https://www.etymonline.com/word/love",
          "https://www.alt-usage-english.org/excerpts/fxloveze.html",
          "https://www.npr.org/2026/06/04/nx-s1-5843257/tennis-love-french-open"
        ]
      }
    },
    "segments": [
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 117.5,
        "end": 122.71,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "赢一分，十五。再赢一分，三十。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/scoring-love-2026/label-w23.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 15.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "主裁报分",
            "date": "2023.07.16",
            "place": "温网 决赛",
            "score": "1-6 7-6(6) 6-1 3-6 6-4",
            "people": "阿尔卡拉斯 vs 德约科维奇"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 157.6,
        "end": 160.6,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.5,
            "end": 2.6,
            "text": "Thirty–fifteen.\n三十比十五"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 0.5,
        "end": 5.88,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "第三分，按理该是四十五，主裁喊的却是四十。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1199.2,
        "end": 1202.2,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.4,
            "end": 2.6,
            "text": "Fifteen–love.\n十五比零"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1203.5,
        "end": 1207.92,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一分没赢，不叫零，叫 love，爱。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 343.0,
        "end": 350.32,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "网球为什么这么数数？没有标准答案。但线索，能追到六百年前。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 8.0,
        "end": 12.46,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "最早的线索，藏在一首法语诗里。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 13.0,
        "end": 21.06,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "作者是奥尔良公爵查理。阿金库尔战役被英军俘虏，在英国当了二十五年人质。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 30.0,
        "end": 37.13,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "诗里，他把人生比作一场球：我已经打到四十五；我们押了注，不是白打。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 44.5,
        "end": 48.46,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "他玩的，正是皇家网球。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/scoring-love-2026/label-rt.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 15.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "皇家网球",
            "date": "2024.11.25",
            "place": "英国公开赛 决赛",
            "score": "2-6 6-4 6-0 6-5",
            "people": "里维埃 vs 豪厄尔"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 58.5,
        "end": 68.03,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "这是现代网球的祖先，在四面高墙、带斜顶棚的室内球场里打。球打到墙上、顶棚上，都还算活球。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 163.5,
        "end": 172.12,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一五五五年，意大利人斯卡伊诺写得明明白白：每赢一分，记十五；第三分，记四十五。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 393.5,
        "end": 399.48,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "可为什么偏偏是十五？流传最广的说法有两个。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 960.0,
        "end": 966.62,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一个说是钟面：一刻钟十五分，转满一圈六十，正好一局。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1320.8,
        "end": 1328.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "可反对的人说，那时的钟大多只有时针。分针普及，要等到十七世纪末。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 202.5,
        "end": 209.22,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "另一个说法来自皇家网球：发球方每赢一分，就往前站十五尺。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 235.0,
        "end": 240.69,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "问题是，当年的皇家网球场，长短并不统一。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 600.0,
        "end": 606.6,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "两种说法都有漏洞。网球史学者争了几百年，至今没有定论。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 925.0,
        "end": 929.46,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "那四十五，又是怎么变成四十的？",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 638.0,
        "end": 646.95,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "钟面说的解释是，给平分留出位置：四十、五十、六十。也有人说，四十只是更好念。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 710.0,
        "end": 714.15,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "哪一种，都拿不出原始证据。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1245.9,
        "end": 1254.9,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "能确定的是，一八七七年第一届温网规则写明：沿用皇家网球的计分，十五、三十、四十。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 785.0,
        "end": 788.07,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "再说 love。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 790.0,
        "end": 795.86,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "最浪漫的说法，是法语里的鸡蛋，因为零的形状像个蛋。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1050.0,
        "end": 1056.86,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "可韦氏词典的词源学家说，找不到法语用鸡蛋表示零分的任何证据。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1200.0,
        "end": 1206.31,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "还有人说来自荷兰语，意思是荣誉：为荣誉而打，不为钱。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1243.5,
        "end": 1249.81,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "词源学家更认可的，是英语里的为爱而玩：不下注，白打。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1464.0,
        "end": 1471.1,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "这个说法十七世纪就有了。到一七四二年，love 已经用来表示零分。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1500.0,
        "end": 1505.98,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "巧的是，公爵那首诗里写的，正是押了注，不是白打。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 427.0,
        "end": 436.86,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "嫌绕口？美国网协的规则手册写着：可以用零、一、二、三，代替 love、十五、三十、四十。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 477.2,
        "end": 484.06,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "国际网联的规则里没有这一条。大满贯赛场上，主裁照样喊 love。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1360.0,
        "end": 1364.87,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "六百年，来历说不清，规矩却一直没改。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1140.0,
        "end": 1150.13,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "十五、三十、四十，再加一个 love。如果让你改成一、二、三、四，你同意吗？评论区说说。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      }
    ],
    "mixed_fps": {}
  }
}
